  "summary": {
    "text": "Aya Expanse is a family of multilingual open-weights language models from Cohere For AI, Cohere's research arm (now Cohere Labs), released in 8B and 32B sizes and aimed at 23 languages. The weights carry a non-commercial CC-BY-NC licence; the models were also offered on the Cohere API and, from January 2025, through WhatsApp.",
