  "notes": "Two sizes released together (8B and 32B), recorded as inline variants. Announced by Cohere For AI, Cohere's research arm, since renamed Cohere Labs. Prominence milestone because Cohere's technical report presents Aya Expanse as a new generation of its Aya multilingual models, succeeding Aya 23 (editorial). The model cards say Aya Expanse pairs a pre-trained model from the Command family with Cohere's multilingual research recipe; no specific base model is named, so no derived-from relation is recorded. The announcement says open weights for 8b and 35b in one place, an apparent slip for 32B."
